#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:4
msgid "スピン制限計算とスピン非制限計算"
msgstr "Spin-Restricted and Spin-Unrestricted Calculations"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:6
msgid ""
"Hartree–Fock（HF）法やKohn–Sham密度汎関数理論（KS-DFT）では、電子の 上向きスピン :math:`\\alpha` "
"と下向きスピン :math:`\\beta` に対する空間軌道の 扱い方として、スピン制限とスピン非制限がある。両スピンに同じ空間軌道を使う "
"**スピン制限計算** と、別々に最適化する **スピン非制限計算** では、同じ分子でも "
"異なる解が得られることがある。本稿では、両者の方程式の違い、非制限解が "
"エネルギーを下げる仕組み、その代償として生じるスピン対称性の破れを式で追う。"
msgstr ""
"Hartree–Fock (HF) and Kohn–Sham density functional theory (KS-DFT) allow "
"two treatments of the spatial orbitals for spin-up :math:`\\alpha` and "
"spin-down :math:`\\beta` electrons. A **spin-restricted calculation** "
"uses the same spatial orbitals for both spins, whereas a **spin-"
"unrestricted calculation** optimizes them separately. The two treatments "
"can yield different solutions for the same molecule. This article uses "
"the equations to show how the two treatments differ, how the unrestricted"
" solution lowers the energy, and why it does so at the cost of breaking "
"spin symmetry."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:13
msgid "**前提知識**: Slater行列式、HF法またはKS-DFTの概要、 :ref:`Löwdin解析<lowdin>` で導入した密度行列。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: Slater determinants, an overview of HF or KS-DFT, and "
"the density matrix introduced in the article on :ref:`Löwdin analysis "
"<lowdin>`."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:16
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:18
msgid "スピン軌道とスピンごとの密度・密度行列を定義する。"
msgstr "Define spin orbitals and the density and density matrix for each spin."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:19
msgid "閉殻のスピン制限方程式と、スピン非制限のPople–Nesbet方程式の違いを説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Explain the difference between the closed-shell spin-restricted equations"
" and the spin-unrestricted Pople–Nesbet equations."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:20
msgid "非制限解のエネルギーが制限解以下になる理由と、安定性解析の考え方を説明する。"
msgstr ""
"Explain why the unrestricted solution has an energy no higher than the "
"restricted solution and how stability analysis works."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:21
msgid "水素分子の解離を例に、スピン対称性の破れとスピン混入を式で確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Use the equations for hydrogen molecule dissociation to examine spin "
"symmetry breaking and spin contamination."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:22
msgid "単一行列式の :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle` を計算し、その値を解釈する。"
msgstr ""
"Calculate :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle` for a single determinant and "
"interpret its value."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:25
msgid "スピン軌道とスピン密度"
msgstr "Spin Orbitals and Spin Density"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:27
msgid ""
"電子1個の状態を、空間軌道 :math:`\\phi(\\boldsymbol r)` とスピン関数 :math:`\\alpha` または "
":math:`\\beta` の積である **スピン軌道** で表す。:math:`N_\\alpha` 個のα電子が 軌道 "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha`、:math:`N_\\beta` 個のβ電子が軌道 :math:`\\phi_i^\\beta` "
"を 占有する単一のSlater行列式を考えると、各スピンの電子密度は"
msgstr ""
"The product of a spatial orbital :math:`\\phi(\\boldsymbol r)` and a spin"
" function :math:`\\alpha` or :math:`\\beta` is a **spin orbital** "
"representing the state of one electron. For a single Slater determinant "
"in which :math:`N_\\alpha` α electrons occupy orbitals "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha` and :math:`N_\\beta` β electrons occupy orbitals "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\beta`, the electron densities for the two spins are"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\rho^\\alpha(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\alpha}|\\phi_i^\\alpha(\\boldsymbol r)|^2,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho^\\beta(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\beta}|\\phi_i^\\beta(\\boldsymbol r)|^2"
msgstr ""
"\\rho^\\alpha(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\alpha}|\\phi_i^\\alpha(\\boldsymbol r)|^2,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho^\\beta(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\beta}|\\phi_i^\\beta(\\boldsymbol r)|^2"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:37
msgid "であり、全電子密度とスピン密度は"
msgstr "and the total electron density and spin density are"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\rho=\\rho^\\alpha+\\rho^\\beta,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho_{\\mathrm s}=\\rho^\\alpha-\\rho^\\beta"
msgstr ""
"\\rho=\\rho^\\alpha+\\rho^\\beta,\\qquad\n"
"\\rho_{\\mathrm s}=\\rho^\\alpha-\\rho^\\beta"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"で与えられる。基底関数 :math:`\\chi_\\mu` で "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\sigma=\\sum_\\mu\\chi_\\mu C^\\sigma_{\\mu i}` "
"と展開すれば、スピンごとの 密度行列は "
":math:`D^\\sigma_{\\mu\\nu}=\\sum_{i}^{N_\\sigma}C^\\sigma_{\\mu "
"i}C^\\sigma_{\\nu i}`、 スピン和は :math:`D=D^\\alpha+D^\\beta` である。"
msgstr ""
"Expanding the spatial orbitals in the basis functions :math:`\\chi_\\mu` "
"as :math:`\\phi_i^\\sigma=\\sum_\\mu\\chi_\\mu C^\\sigma_{\\mu i}` gives "
"the spin-resolved density matrix "
":math:`D^\\sigma_{\\mu\\nu}=\\sum_{i}^{N_\\sigma}C^\\sigma_{\\mu "
"i}C^\\sigma_{\\nu i}` and the spin-summed density matrix "
":math:`D=D^\\alpha+D^\\beta`."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:51
msgid "スピン制限計算"
msgstr "Spin-Restricted Calculations"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:53
msgid ""
"閉殻の **スピン制限計算** では、:math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=N/2` とし、両スピンに 同じ空間軌道 "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha=\\phi_i^\\beta=\\phi_i` を使う。各空間軌道に 電子が対になって入り、"
msgstr ""
"A closed-shell **spin-restricted calculation** sets "
":math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=N/2` and uses the same spatial orbitals "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha=\\phi_i^\\beta=\\phi_i` for both spins. Each "
"spatial orbital is occupied by a pair of electrons, giving"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"D^\\alpha=D^\\beta=\\frac{D}{2},\\qquad \\rho_{\\mathrm s}(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=0"
msgstr ""
"D^\\alpha=D^\\beta=\\frac{D}{2},\\qquad \\rho_{\\mathrm s}(\\boldsymbol "
"r)=0"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:61
msgid "となる。HF法では軌道係数がRoothaan方程式"
msgstr "In HF, the orbital coefficients satisfy the Roothaan equation"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:63
msgid "FC=SC\\varepsilon"
msgstr "FC=SC\\varepsilon"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:67
msgid ""
"を満たす。:math:`S` は重なり行列、:math:`\\varepsilon` は軌道エネルギーの "
"対角行列である。この方法をRHF（restricted HF）と呼び、KS-DFTで対応する方法を "
"RKSと呼ぶ。不対電子をもつ系を、二重占有の軌道と単占有の軌道を共通の空間軌道で 扱う制限開殻HF（ROHF）もある。"
msgstr ""
"Here :math:`S` is the overlap matrix and :math:`\\varepsilon` is the "
"diagonal matrix of orbital energies. This method is called restricted "
"Hartree–Fock (RHF). The corresponding method in KS-DFT is called RKS. For"
" systems with unpaired electrons, restricted open-shell Hartree–Fock "
"(ROHF) uses a common set of spatial orbitals for the doubly and singly "
"occupied orbitals."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:73
msgid "スピン非制限計算"
msgstr "Spin-Unrestricted Calculations"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:75
msgid "**スピン非制限計算** では、α電子とβ電子の空間軌道を別々に最適化する。 HF法の場合、係数はPople–Nesbet方程式 [PN1954]_"
msgstr ""
"A **spin-unrestricted calculation** optimizes the spatial orbitals for α "
"and β electrons separately. In HF, the coefficients satisfy the "
"Pople–Nesbet equations [PN1954]_"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:78
msgid ""
"F^\\alpha C^\\alpha=SC^\\alpha\\varepsilon^\\alpha,\\qquad\n"
"F^\\beta C^\\beta=SC^\\beta\\varepsilon^\\beta"
msgstr ""
"F^\\alpha C^\\alpha=SC^\\alpha\\varepsilon^\\alpha,\\qquad\n"
"F^\\beta C^\\beta=SC^\\beta\\varepsilon^\\beta"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:84
msgid "を満たす。αスピンのFock行列は"
msgstr "The Fock matrix for α spin is"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"F^\\alpha_{\\mu\\nu}=h_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"+\\sum_{\\lambda\\sigma}\\Bigl[D_{\\lambda\\sigma}(\\mu\\nu|\\sigma\\lambda)"
"\n"
"-D^\\alpha_{\\lambda\\sigma}(\\mu\\lambda|\\sigma\\nu)\\Bigr]"
msgstr ""
"F^\\alpha_{\\mu\\nu}=h_{\\mu\\nu}\n"
"+\\sum_{\\lambda\\sigma}\\Bigl[D_{\\lambda\\sigma}(\\mu\\nu|\\sigma\\lambda)"
"\n"
"-D^\\alpha_{\\lambda\\sigma}(\\mu\\lambda|\\sigma\\nu)\\Bigr]"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:93
msgid ""
"で、:math:`F^\\beta` は :math:`\\alpha` と :math:`\\beta` を入れ替えたものである。 "
":math:`h` は1電子ハミルトニアン、:math:`(\\mu\\nu|\\lambda\\sigma)` は2電子積分である。 "
"第2項のCoulomb項は全電子密度 :math:`D` で決まり、両スピンに共通である。 "
"第3項の交換項は同じスピンの電子どうしにしか働かないので、:math:`D^\\alpha` だけで "
"決まる。2つの方程式はCoulomb項を通じて結合しており、自己無撞着に解く。 この方法をUHF（unrestricted HF）と呼ぶ。KS-"
"DFTでは交換項の代わりに、 :math:`\\rho^\\alpha` と :math:`\\rho^\\beta` "
"に依存する交換相関ポテンシャル :math:`v^\\sigma_{\\mathrm{xc}}` を使い、この方法をUKSと呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"The corresponding matrix :math:`F^\\beta` follows by interchanging "
":math:`\\alpha` and :math:`\\beta`. Here :math:`h` is the one-electron "
"Hamiltonian and :math:`(\\mu\\nu|\\lambda\\sigma)` denotes a two-electron"
" integral. The second term, the Coulomb term, depends on the total "
"electron density :math:`D` and is common to both spins. The third term, "
"the exchange term, acts only between electrons of the same spin and "
"therefore depends only on :math:`D^\\alpha`. The Coulomb term couples the"
" two equations, which are solved self-consistently. This method is called"
" unrestricted Hartree–Fock (UHF). In KS-DFT, the exchange term is "
"replaced by an exchange-correlation potential that depends on "
":math:`\\rho^\\alpha` and :math:`\\rho^\\beta`, denoted by "
":math:`v^\\sigma_{\\mathrm{xc}}`. This method is called UKS."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:102
msgid ""
":eq:`sr-fock-alpha` から、:math:`D^\\alpha=D^\\beta` ならば "
":math:`F^\\alpha=F^\\beta` となる。 "
"したがってRHF解は常にUHF方程式の解でもある。問題は、それがエネルギーの最小点か どうかである。"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`sr-fock-alpha` shows that if :math:`D^\\alpha=D^\\beta`, "
"then :math:`F^\\alpha=F^\\beta`. The RHF solution is therefore always a "
"solution of the UHF equations as well. The question is whether it is an "
"energy minimum."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:107
msgid "変分原理と安定性"
msgstr "Variational Principle and Stability"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:109
msgid ""
"UHFの試行関数は、:math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha=\\phi_i^\\beta` という制約を外したものなので、 "
"RHFの試行関数をすべて含む。変分原理から、最低エネルギーの解について"
msgstr ""
"The UHF trial functions relax the constraint "
":math:`\\phi_i^\\alpha=\\phi_i^\\beta` and thus include all RHF trial "
"functions. By the variational principle, the lowest-energy solutions "
"satisfy"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:112
msgid "E_{\\mathrm{UHF}}\\le E_{\\mathrm{RHF}}"
msgstr "E_{\\mathrm{UHF}}\\le E_{\\mathrm{RHF}}"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:116
msgid ""
"が成り立つ。等号が成り立つ（UHF解がRHF解に一致する）系も多いが、RHF解の近くに "
"エネルギーを下げる方向があれば、UHFはスピン密度をもつ別の解に移る。"
msgstr ""
"For many systems, equality holds and the UHF solution coincides with the "
"RHF solution. But if a direction near the RHF solution lowers the energy,"
" UHF moves to a different solution with nonzero spin density."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:119
msgid ""
"これを判定するのが **安定性解析** である。SCF解の周りで占有軌道と空軌道を "
"わずかに混ぜる回転を考え、エネルギーを回転のパラメータの2次まで展開する。 "
"その係数行列（軌道ヘシアン）がすべて正の固有値をもてば、その解は考えた変分空間で "
"局所的な最小である。負の固有値があれば、その固有ベクトルの方向にエネルギーの低い 解が存在する "
"[SP1977]_。RHF解に対しては、αとβの軌道を同じように回転させる "
"RHF→RHF（一重項）の安定性と、αとβを逆向きに回転させてスピン密度を生じさせる "
"RHF→UHF（三重項）の安定性を調べる。後者に負の固有値があれば、RHF解より エネルギーの低いUHF解がある。"
msgstr ""
"**Stability analysis** determines whether such a direction exists. "
"Consider small rotations that mix occupied and unoccupied orbitals around"
" the self-consistent field (SCF) solution, and expand the energy to "
"second order in the rotation parameters. If all eigenvalues of the "
"coefficient matrix (the orbital Hessian) are positive, the solution is a "
"local minimum in the variational space under consideration. If an "
"eigenvalue is negative, there is a lower-energy solution in the direction"
" of its eigenvector [SP1977]_. For an RHF solution, test RHF-to-RHF "
"(singlet) stability by rotating the α and β orbitals together, and RHF-"
"to-UHF (triplet) stability by rotating them in opposite directions to "
"produce a spin density. A negative eigenvalue in the latter test means "
"there is a UHF solution with lower energy than the RHF solution."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:129
msgid "簡単な例：水素分子の解離"
msgstr "Simple Example: Dissociation of the Hydrogen Molecule"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:131
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"最小基底の水素分子で、2つの原子の1s関数を :math:`\\chi_A`、:math:`\\chi_B`、 重なりを :math:`s` "
"とする。RHFでは両方の電子が結合性軌道 :math:`\\sigma_g=(\\chi_A+\\chi_B)/\\sqrt{2(1+s)}` "
"に入り、波動関数の空間部分は"
msgstr ""
"For a hydrogen molecule in a minimal basis, let :math:`\\chi_A` and "
":math:`\\chi_B` be the two atomic 1s functions and :math:`s` their "
"overlap. In RHF, both electrons occupy the bonding orbital "
":math:`\\sigma_g=(\\chi_A+\\chi_B)/\\sqrt{2(1+s)}`, so the spatial part "
"of the wave function is"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:135
msgid ""
"\\sigma_g(1)\\sigma_g(2)=\\frac{1}{2(1+s)}\n"
"\\Bigl[\\underbrace{\\chi_A(1)\\chi_B(2)+\\chi_B(1)\\chi_A(2)}_{\\text{共有結合項}}"
"\n"
"+\\underbrace{\\chi_A(1)\\chi_A(2)+\\chi_B(1)\\chi_B(2)}_{\\text{イオン項}}\\Bigr]"
msgstr ""
"\\sigma_g(1)\\sigma_g(2)=\\frac{1}{2(1+s)}\n"
"\\Bigl[\\underbrace{\\chi_A(1)\\chi_B(2)+\\chi_B(1)\\chi_A(2)}_{\\text{covalent"
" term}}\n"
"+\\underbrace{\\chi_A(1)\\chi_A(2)+\\chi_B(1)\\chi_B(2)}_{\\text{ionic "
"term}}\\Bigr]"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:142
msgid ""
"となる。共有結合項は2つの電子が別々の原子にいる配置（H–H）、イオン項は 両方が同じ原子にいる配置（H\\ :sup:`+`\\ H\\ "
":sup:`−`）を表す。RHFでは両者の重みが 原子間距離によらず等しい。原子を引き離すと、正しい解離極限は中性の水素原子2個 "
"であるにもかかわらず、RHFのエネルギーはイオン対の寄与を含んだまま高い値に向かう。"
msgstr ""
"The covalent term describes configurations with the two electrons on "
"different atoms (H–H), whereas the ionic term describes configurations "
"with both electrons on the same atom (H\\ :sup:`+`\\ H\\ :sup:`−`). In "
"RHF, the two terms have equal weight regardless of the interatomic "
"distance. As the atoms separate, the RHF energy retains a contribution "
"from the ion pair and approaches a high value, even though the correct "
"dissociation limit consists of two neutral hydrogen atoms."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:147
msgid "UHFでは、α電子とβ電子の軌道を"
msgstr ""
"In UHF, the orbitals of the α and β electrons can be chosen independently"
" as"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:149
msgid ""
"\\phi^\\alpha\\propto\\cos\\theta\\,\\chi_A+\\sin\\theta\\,\\chi_B,\\qquad"
"\n"
"\\phi^\\beta\\propto\\sin\\theta\\,\\chi_A+\\cos\\theta\\,\\chi_B"
msgstr ""
"\\phi^\\alpha\\propto\\cos\\theta\\,\\chi_A+\\sin\\theta\\,\\chi_B,\\qquad"
"\n"
"\\phi^\\beta\\propto\\sin\\theta\\,\\chi_A+\\cos\\theta\\,\\chi_B"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:154
msgid ""
"のように別々に選べる。:math:`\\theta=\\pi/4` がRHFの解である。原子間距離が "
"Coulson–Fischer点と呼ばれる距離を超えると、:math:`\\theta\\ne\\pi/4` の解の方が "
"エネルギーが低くなり、α電子とβ電子が別々の原子に偏る [CF1949]_。 "
"解離極限（:math:`s\\to0`、:math:`\\theta\\to0`）では、α電子が原子A、β電子が 原子Bにある行列式"
msgstr ""
"The choice :math:`\\theta=\\pi/4` gives the RHF solution. Once the "
"interatomic distance exceeds the Coulson–Fischer point, the solution with"
" :math:`\\theta\\ne\\pi/4` has lower energy, and the α and β electrons "
"favor different atoms [CF1949]_. In the dissociation limit "
"(:math:`s\\to0` and :math:`\\theta\\to0`), the α electron is on atom A "
"and the β electron on atom B, giving the determinant"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:160
msgid ""
"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{UHF}}=|\\chi_A\\alpha\\,\\chi_B\\beta|\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\left({}^1\\Psi+{}^3\\Psi_0\\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{UHF}}=|\\chi_A\\alpha\\,\\chi_B\\beta|\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\left({}^1\\Psi+{}^3\\Psi_0\\right)"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:166
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"となり、エネルギーは水素原子2個の和に一致する。ここで :math:`{}^1\\Psi` は 一重項（共有結合の Heitler–London "
"関数）、:math:`{}^3\\Psi_0` は :math:`M_S=0` の三重項である。UHFは正しい解離エネルギーを与える代わりに、 "
"一重項と三重項が半分ずつ混ざった、全スピンの定まらない状態になっている。"
msgstr ""
"The energy equals the sum of the energies of two hydrogen atoms. Here "
":math:`{}^1\\Psi` is the singlet (the covalent Heitler–London function), "
"and :math:`{}^3\\Psi_0` is the :math:`M_S=0` triplet. UHF gives the "
"correct dissociation energy, but the state is an equal mixture of singlet"
" and triplet and has no definite total spin."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:172
msgid "スピン混入と :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle`"
msgstr "Spin Contamination and :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle`"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:174
msgid ""
"非相対論的なハミルトニアンはスピンに依存しないので、厳密な固有状態は全スピン 演算子 :math:`\\hat S^2` "
"の固有状態であり、:math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle=S(S+1)` となる。 "
"単一のSlater行列式では、:math:`S_z=(N_\\alpha-N_\\beta)/2` として"
msgstr ""
"The nonrelativistic Hamiltonian is spin independent, so exact eigenstates"
" are eigenstates of the total-spin operator :math:`\\hat S^2`, with "
":math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle=S(S+1)`. For a single Slater "
"determinant, setting :math:`S_z=(N_\\alpha-N_\\beta)/2` gives"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:178
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle\n"
"=S_z(S_z+1)+N_\\beta\n"
"-\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\alpha}\\sum_{j=1}^{N_\\beta}\n"
"\\bigl|\\langle\\phi_i^\\alpha|\\phi_j^\\beta\\rangle\\bigr|^2"
msgstr ""
"\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle\n"
"=S_z(S_z+1)+N_\\beta\n"
"-\\sum_{i=1}^{N_\\alpha}\\sum_{j=1}^{N_\\beta}\n"
"\\bigl|\\langle\\phi_i^\\alpha|\\phi_j^\\beta\\rangle\\bigr|^2"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:186
msgid ""
"が成り立つ [Szabo1996]_。閉殻RHFでは占有軌道どうしの重なりが単位行列になり、 最後の和が :math:`N_\\beta` "
"に等しいので :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle=0` である。 "
"非制限計算でαとβの占有軌道がずれると、重なりの和が減り、:math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle` は正しい値 "
":math:`S(S+1)` より大きくなる。この、異なる全スピンの状態が混ざる 現象を **スピン混入** という。:math:`S_z=0` "
"の場合、:eq:`sr-s2` から :math:`0\\le\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle\\le N_\\beta` "
"であり、上限はαとβの占有軌道が 互いに直交するときに達する。"
msgstr ""
"as given in [Szabo1996]_. In closed-shell RHF, the overlap between the "
"occupied orbitals of the two spins is the identity matrix, so the last "
"sum equals :math:`N_\\beta` and :math:`\\langle\\hat S^2\\rangle=0`. If "
"the occupied α and β orbitals differ in an unrestricted calculation, the "
"sum of the squared overlaps decreases, and :math:`\\langle\\hat "
"S^2\\rangle` exceeds the correct value :math:`S(S+1)`. This mixing of "
"states with different total spin is called **spin contamination**. For "
":math:`S_z=0`, Equation :eq:`sr-s2` gives :math:`0\\le\\langle\\hat "
"S^2\\rangle\\le N_\\beta`. The upper bound is reached when the occupied α"
" and β orbitals are orthogonal to one another."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:194
msgid ""
"解離した水素分子 :eq:`sr-h2-uhf` では :math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=1`、 "
":math:`\\langle\\chi_A|\\chi_B\\rangle=0` なので :math:`\\langle\\hat "
"S^2\\rangle=1` となり、 一重項（0）と三重項（2）を半分ずつ混ぜた値に一致する。"
msgstr ""
"For the dissociated hydrogen molecule in Equation :eq:`sr-h2-uhf`, "
":math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=1` and "
":math:`\\langle\\chi_A|\\chi_B\\rangle=0`, so :math:`\\langle\\hat "
"S^2\\rangle=1`, as expected for an equal mixture of the singlet (0) and "
"triplet (2)."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:199
msgid "αとβの軌道エネルギーが一致する場合"
msgstr "When the α and β Orbital Energies Coincide"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:201
msgid ""
"スピン非制限解ではαとβのFock行列が異なるので、軌道エネルギーも一般には異なる。 "
"ただし、空間対称操作でαとβの分布が入れ替わる場合は一致する。原子の並べ替えを 表す直交行列を :math:`R`\\ "
"（:math:`R^2=I`）とし、:math:`h`、:math:`S`、2電子積分が :math:`R` で不変であるとする。解が"
msgstr ""
"In a spin-unrestricted solution, the α and β Fock matrices differ, so "
"their orbital energies generally differ as well. However, the energies "
"coincide if a spatial symmetry operation interchanges the α and β "
"distributions. Let :math:`R`\\ (:math:`R^2=I`) be the orthogonal matrix "
"that permutes the atoms, and assume that :math:`h`, :math:`S`, and the "
"two-electron integrals are invariant under :math:`R`. If the solution "
"satisfies"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid "D^\\beta=RD^\\alpha R^{\\mathsf T}"
msgstr "D^\\beta=RD^\\alpha R^{\\mathsf T}"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:210
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"を満たすと、全密度 :math:`D=D^\\alpha+D^\\beta` は :math:`R` で不変になる。 :eq:`sr-fock-"
"alpha` のCoulomb項は不変で、交換項は :math:`D^\\alpha` から :math:`D^\\beta` に移るので "
":math:`F^\\beta=RF^\\alpha R^{\\mathsf T}` となる。 :math:`F^\\alpha` と "
":math:`F^\\beta` は直交変換で結ばれるから、 :eq:`sr-pople-nesbet` "
"の固有値は一致する。例えば偶数個の原子からなる鎖の 反転 :math:`i\\to N+1-i` "
"は奇数番目と偶数番目の原子を入れ替えるので、1つおきに スピンが反転した解はこの条件を満たしうる。"
msgstr ""
"then the total density :math:`D=D^\\alpha+D^\\beta` is invariant under "
":math:`R`. The Coulomb term in Equation :eq:`sr-fock-alpha` is invariant,"
" and the exchange term changes from one depending on :math:`D^\\alpha` to"
" one depending on :math:`D^\\beta`, giving :math:`F^\\beta=RF^\\alpha "
"R^{\\mathsf T}`. Since :math:`F^\\alpha` and :math:`F^\\beta` are related"
" by an orthogonal transformation, the eigenvalues in Equation :eq:`sr-"
"pople-nesbet` coincide. For example, reversing a chain with an even "
"number of atoms, :math:`i\\to N+1-i`, interchanges odd- and even-numbered"
" atoms, so a solution with alternating spins can satisfy this condition."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:219
msgid "説明用の事例：水素原子鎖"
msgstr "Worked Example: Hydrogen Atom Chain"

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:221
msgid ""
"`水素原子を並べると電子バンドは生まれるのか <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_ では、STO-"
"3G基底で原子間隔1.8 Åの中性水素原子鎖を、RHF、RKS-PBE、UHF、UKS-PBEで 計算している（Psi4 "
"1.10、:math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=N/2`）。例題の再現用データから、 :math:`N=32` の値を次にまとめる。"
msgstr ""
"The calculation example `Do Electronic Bands Form in a Hydrogen Atom "
"Chain? <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/hydrogen_chain/band_formation.html>`_ uses RHF, RKS-"
"PBE, UHF, and UKS-PBE for a neutral hydrogen atom chain with an "
"interatomic spacing of 1.8 Å and an STO-3G basis (Psi4 1.10, "
":math:`N_\\alpha=N_\\beta=N/2`). The table gives the values for "
":math:`N=32` from the data provided to reproduce the example."

#: ../../electronic/spin_restriction.rst:226
msgid ":math:`N=32` の水素原子鎖でのスピン制限解と非制限解"
msgstr ""
"Spin-restricted and spin-unrestricted solutions for a hydrogen atom chain"
" with :math:`N=32`"

